WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:11.440
This athletic meet is the first, and last, one that all of the Hamada siblings can participate in at once.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:15.120
Everyone, let's do our best and make this our best athletic meet.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.660
The Hamada siblings! Fight!

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:58.730
Go, Doremi-chan!

00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:04.610
Doremi-chan?

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:05.430
Be careful!

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:11.120
Doremi! How can we win with you messing up like that?

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:13.210
Be serious for a change, will you!?

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:14.980
Shut up! My hand just slipped, that's all.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.930
Don't talk while running!

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:20.290
What? You think you're good or something?

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:21.150
Idiot! Stop that!

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.600
Stop right there, Kotake!

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:24.950
Doremi-chan.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.990
Stop that.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:30.130
Let's practice seriously, okay? Doremi-chan.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.160
But!

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:33.880
What did I do?

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.490
I can't believe Harukaze-san is in the race.

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:40.600
If I hadn't lost at rock, paper, scissors, I would be the one running!

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:51.070
Great Panic at the Athletic Meet!

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.240
Go! Go!

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:09.240
I would like the third and fourth grade athletic meet committees to make paper flowers.

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:12.410
Now I shall announce what the fifth and sixth grade committees will do.

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.560
Excuse me.

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:19.510
The Hamada siblings from class 6-1 and from class 5-2 haven't returned from the relay race yet.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.560
Let's see... Hamada Kazuo-san and Kimia-san, right?

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:27.770
Then we'll have someone from their respective classes tell them about this later.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.950
Hamada-san's little sister from your class is joining the relay race, right?

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.380
Eh? Hamada?

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.920
Do you mean Itoko-chan?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:35.750
Yes.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:36.940
She is.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.450
I knew it.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.400
Hamada Sachio-kun from our class is also running.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:44.370
All of them will be participating in this athletic meet.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.030
The six Hamada siblings.

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:47.960
S-Six?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:54.040
A-Are the Hamadas that we're talking about the brothers and sisters of Itoko-chan?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.120
Yes.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.700
First grader Potan-chan.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.260
Second grader Teruo-kun.

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.870
Third grader Itoko-chan.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.360
Fourth grader Sachio-kun.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.840
Fifth grader Kinuyo-san.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.100
And sixth grader Kazuo-san.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:11.060
I heard that she had siblings, but I didn't know she had five of them.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.450
Why aren't they here yet!?

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.630
Dodo brought a message from them.

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:29.210
They said they are going to be a bit late because they're preparing for the athletic meet.

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.450
What do you mean, "A bit late!?"

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.750
Which is more important, the athletic meet or the Maho-dou?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.030
Of course it's the athletic meet.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:38.720
What!?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.780
The athletic meet is a lot of fun, that's why.

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.710
There are running events and ball throwing events.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:47.650
And the lunchboxes are a lot more special and filling than normal.

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:50.770
I'll be going with Dad and Mom to see it.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:53.730
Pop, even you think so?

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:56.230
You traitor.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.300
You're worrying too much.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.150
Oh yeah.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.790
Plush-chan, you should go see Doremi's athletic meet.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.650
I'll secretly give you some of my lunch.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.780
Don't call me that!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.660
Who wants to go see some boring athletic meet, anyway?

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.270
Sorry we're late!

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:15.080
Pop-chan, ya sure were busy by yerself, weren'tcha?

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.580
Sorry.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.900
It was nothing.

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.000
What nerve!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:23.930
How can you forget about the Maho-dou because of some athletic meet!?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:27.970
Pop, I'm one of the athletes for the relay.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:29.710
No way!

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.790
It's true.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:33.350
Doremi-chan, let's do our best together!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.250
Okay!

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:36.970
Can you pass and catch the baton properly, Doremi?

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.830
Don't worry, I'm getting special training for that.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:40.890
Right, Ai-chan?

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:42.190
Well... I guess so.

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.070
I knew it.

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:45.090
What's with that tone, Pop?

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.130
Don't worry about it.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.400
What, what?

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.820
Is something interesting happening?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:52.020
How's the work comin' fer the athletic meet, Hadzuki-chan?

00:05:52.020 --> 00:05:55.290
I made paper flowers today with my upperclassmen.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.170
I see, an athletic meet, eh?

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:58.450
I love them too.

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.320
Can you take me with you?

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:04.260
Oh yeah, did you know about Itoko-chan's five siblings?

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:06.170
There's six of them?

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.970
I knew that she had brothers and sisters, but...

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.350
They are all here this year, from first grade to sixth grade.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.930
And they are all relay racers.

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:18.640
I feel the presence of a Bad Item.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.820
That trick again?

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:25.950
Ya jus' want us to take ya to the athletic meet, am I right?

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:29.070
No! I really sense something!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:31.010
That's great.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.330
So what are you doing tomorrow, Hadzuki-chan?

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.240
Please.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.420
I'll bring the finished flowers...

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:37.980
Athletic meet, athletic meet...

00:06:37.980 --> 00:06:40.580
Is that all that's on your brains right now!?

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.040
Don't get mad, don't get mad.

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:46.090
I'll always stand by your side, Plush-chan.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:50.450
Every single one of you annoys me to no end!

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:13.410
So, did you all work hard for the athletic meet?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:17.010
We did, Grandpa!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:19.370
I see, I see.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.730
Tomorrow is finally the athletic meet.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.430
Yeah, I'm getting so excited.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:30.290
We're sorry we're late.

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.040
Please take care of that side.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:33.010
Okay.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:39.020
Fall Semester Athletic Meet

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.390
Okay, let's do our best.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.690
If you don't learn how to catch and pass the baton properly,

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.060
then get out of the relay race!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.600
Okay, let's train.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.150
Okay!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.330
Not again...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.910
I think training is useless for her.

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.620
The underclassmen really helped us.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:16.300
We are part of the athletic meet committee, so we don't have much time to practice for the relay.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.720
It was nothing, I like making paper goods.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:25.270
And Itoko-chan's family is amazing, having all six of you enter the relay.

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.270
My brother will be a middle schooler next year.

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.200
This year is our only chance.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.990
So we want to make it our best.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.380
So that's how it is.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.950
Ahhh, why, why!?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.130
It's all because of this hand! This hand, this hand!

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.200
Stop hittin' yerself, Doremi.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:45.360
In order to catch the baton, you can't be thinking about it all the time.

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:48.520
You must trust the runner giving you the baton.

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:50.090
Eh? Yeah...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.120
Big brother! Big sister!

00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:54.050
Oh? Those're ya siblings?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.760
Her big brother in sixth grade and her big sister in fifth grade.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.220
You both look just like Itoko-chan.

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:02.060
Let us demonstrate for you.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:02.810
O-Okay.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.820
Do it again like I showed you.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:08.940
Ah, okay.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.410
Fall Semester Athletic Meet

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.120
Papa, Mama, Baaya!

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:33.090
I wonder if Mom packed the fried chicken like I asked her to.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:36.050
Hey, where's Ai-chan's father?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:39.930
Ai-chan's a relay racer, so he's definitely coming.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:41.060
Well...

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.480
He's over there!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:46.480
Ai-chan's father!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.650
He took time off today.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.890
Jeez.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.740
What an old-fashioned family.

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:54.440
No joke.

00:09:58.950 --> 00:09:59.660
Jeeeez!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.790
Grandpa, didn't I tell you that that's embarrassing?

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.450
This is the only relay race that all of us are participating in.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:10.500
Let Grandpa enjoy himself.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.560
And the best part is, we're all on the red team.

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.170
Okay everyone, let's give it our all!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.300
The six Hamada siblings! Fight!

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.260
Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.480
I think it's kind of embarrassing.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.090
That's not true.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:28.440
It's really cool.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:32.200
For the Hamadas, let's do our best today!

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.230
Yeah!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.150
Thank you.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:50.540
Go red!

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.500
Go Teruo!

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.520
Potan! Do your best!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.750
Potan, are you okay?

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.190
Yeah!

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.430
Ready!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.040
Big bro Sachi!

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.840
Go!

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.310
Big bro Sachi...

00:12:01.910 --> 00:12:04.410
We should have made better preparations.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:07.370
Why are so many accidents happening?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.670
It's our only athletic meet too...

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.010
I'm so sad...

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.150
Highlighted: Noon Break

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:41.770
That fried chicken is mine!

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:43.250
First come, first serve!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:44.820
Wow...

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:48.200
Doremi-chan, want to try my father's fried eggs?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.200
I'd be glad to!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.450
I'll take these!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.820
So? Are they delicious?

00:12:52.820 --> 00:12:54.290
They're delicious.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.250
Want some fruits?

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:57.390
I'll take these too!

00:12:57.390 --> 00:12:59.260
Jeez, Pop.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.140
The Hamada siblings look so sad.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:09.050
It was their only athletic meet together, too.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.360
Yeah... But somethin' ain't right here.

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.400
Yeah.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:16.020
It's like they're getting toyed with by something evil.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:27.910
It's a Bad Item!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.160
Hurry up, Pop.

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.070
If you really want to eat this I'll give it to you, Doremi.

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.310
That's not what I'm talking about...

00:13:48.150 --> 00:13:50.640
Pretty Witchy Pop-chi!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.770
Pop, hurry!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:54.970
Okay!

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.460
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:20.570
Pipitto Puritto Puritan Peperuto!

00:14:20.570 --> 00:14:22.710
Let me pass, forest!

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:28.650
Plush-chan!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.170
What on Earth is going on!?

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.580
Where are you Pop?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.110
Somethin' bad's gonna happen!

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.360
It happened again!

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.170
It's Pop-chan!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:52.950
Here you go!

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.300
Thank you.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.370
Beautiful legs!

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:11.390
Oh, it's just Doremi.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.090
There you go again.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.350
Oyajiide, there's a Bad Item!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.600
What!?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.810
See? I was right.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.730
I guess Oyajiide can be right sometimes, too.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.730
You sound like I'm off most of the time!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.650
Okay, let's go.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:27.830
Do your best.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.620
We'll leave the rest to them, so let's go home, Lala.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:31.440
Nope.

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:35.220
I finally brought you over here, so I'll have you see the athletic meet.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:37.790
That hurts! Let go of me! Let go!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.620
Excuse us.

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.620
Nope! Nope!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:46.300
I don't want to see these boring old men!

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:48.510
Ain't ya one yerself?

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:50.970
That one over there is suspicious! Over there!

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:51.720
Really?

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:57.470
I can't see anything with those pants.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:58.960
Nope! Nope!

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:01.190
What's this?

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.400
Ah, this is...

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:03.970
It's a video game!

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.580
Looks stupid, doesn't it?

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.860
Excuse us!

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.910
Get serious with your searching, Oyajiide!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:13.500
Don'tcha want to find the Bad Cards?

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.450
I get it, I get it.

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.410
Nope!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.120
No, no, no!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:21.490
No way!

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:24.170
I wonder if Doremi and the others are okay.

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.410
This is more tiring than I thought.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:28.040
Give me that doll for a second!

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.650
I'll give it back to you later!

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:35.280
Plush-chan!

00:16:35.280 --> 00:16:36.300
Majo Rika!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.640
Just where on earth is that Bad Item?

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.060
Are these accidents really bein' caused by a Bad Item?

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:49.260
Will the relay racers please gather at the track please.

00:16:49.260 --> 00:16:50.260
That's you two!

00:16:50.260 --> 00:16:50.990
Let's go!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.290
Doremi-chan!

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:57.430
Ow, ow, ow! Who put this line maker here?

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:58.230
A-Are you okay?

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:00.200
That's it, that's it, that's it, that's it, that's it, that's it, that's it!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.080
Don't tell me... This?

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:04.580
THAT'S IT!!!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.840
Alright!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:07.250
Let's take out the Bad Card, quickly!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.500
But what about your relay?

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:14.620
What's that Doremi and Aiko doing?

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.970
Don't worry.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:20.430
We will be glad to be the substitutes for those girls with no sense of responsibility.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.890
Eeeehhhh!?

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.850
In any case, this comes first.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.540
Right.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.500
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:43.740
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.670
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:12.120
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:18.830
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.420
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.870
Magical Stage!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.700
Come out, Bad Card!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:57.510
Doremi-chan.

00:18:57.510 --> 00:18:58.200
Right.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.080
Thank goodness.

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.830
Up next is the third grade relay race.

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:08.620
Oh no!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:12.080
Plush-chan and Doremi and the others aren't back yet!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.430
Now then, racers, come take your places.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.040
What's Doremi and Aiko doing?

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.500
We practiced so much, too...

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.350
Who cares about them.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:24.000
You girls need to buzz off.

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:25.470
Sorry for the wait.

00:19:25.470 --> 00:19:26.550
Doremi-chan.

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:27.930
Where were you?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.800
The third grade relay race will begin now.

00:19:32.510 --> 00:19:33.900
Ready...

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:38.610
Go! Itoko!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.080
Itoko-chan!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.160
Faster, faster!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:57.340
Go, Ai-chan!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.920
Dad!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:03.180
Dash away faster and faster!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.930
The baton catch...

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:09.140
I'll be fine. Itoko-chan's brother and sister taught me how to do it.

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:24.700
Yes!

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:30.080
Doremi, go, go!

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.840
Keep going, Kotake!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.800
Out of my way, out of my way!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.150
This is it!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.810
Yes!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:16.880
White Team
Red Team

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:21.840
Good job.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.620
That's my Hamada siblings.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:27.800
Victory

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.360
A lot happened, but we found the Bad Item.

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:33.200
That was an awesome athletic meet.

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:33.910
Yes.

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.520
Itoko-chan and her family thought so too.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.690
See ya!

00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.740
Where is this place!?

00:21:56.740 --> 00:21:58.810
Who am I!?

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:02.960
Senoo Aiko-sama

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:03.840
Atsuko

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:06.800
She wrote that she wanted to see me.

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:09.240
I want to see her too!

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:10.960
I...

00:22:11.980 --> 00:22:15.140
I run as hard as I can, as the sun is setting in Misora.

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:17.360
I want to see Mom.

00:22:17.360 --> 00:22:19.140
I want to see Mom!

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:22.750
I'm really runnin' as hard as I can!

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:24.280
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:25.870
I Want to See Mom!

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:28.560
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
